# Tier 3 Manual Checklist for {{PROJECT_NAME}}

Tick each item as you run it on the physical device. Type `tier3:PASS` once every item passes. Any single failure means the build is not ready.

## Push notifications

- [ ] Foreground notification fires the in-app handler.
- [ ] Background notification appears in tray.
- [ ] Tapping a background notification opens the correct screen.
- [ ] Tapping a notification after force-quit cold-starts to the correct screen.

## Camera and microphone

- [ ] Camera permission prompt appears on first use.
- [ ] Denied permission shows a friendly fallback.
- [ ] Captured images are the expected resolution.
- [ ] Microphone permission prompt appears on first use.
- [ ] Audio recording replays clearly.

## Location

- [ ] Location permission prompt appears.
- [ ] Location accuracy is within fifty meters of true position.
- [ ] Location resolves on cell-only.

## Biometric authentication

- [ ] Face ID or Touch ID prompt appears.
- [ ] Cancel falls back to passcode.
- [ ] Successful auth loads the protected screen.

## Deep links

- [ ] Deep link from email opens the target screen.
- [ ] Deep link from SMS opens the target screen.
- [ ] Deep link cold-start works.

## Network resilience

- [ ] Airplane mode produces a clear error, not a crash.
- [ ] Reconnecting and retrying works.
- [ ] Wi-Fi to cell handoff is clean.

## Performance

- [ ] Cold start under three seconds.
- [ ] Long list scrolls smoothly.
- [ ] Battery saver mode does not break the app.

## Display

- [ ] Orientation lock holds.
- [ ] Dark Mode follows system preference (if intended).
- [ ] Dynamic Type extra-large does not clip text.

## Privacy

- [ ] Screenshot blocking enforced on protected screens (if intended).
- [ ] App switcher blurs sensitive screens (if intended).

## Installation

- [ ] App icon present on home screen.
- [ ] Icon matches assets/icon.png.
- [ ] Launch screen matches assets/splash.png.

